    "lists": {
      "ordered": [
        {
          "text": "Open Obsidian Settings (`Ctrl/Cmd + ,`)",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 46,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Navigate to **Community Plugins**",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 48,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Verify each required plugin is installed and **enabled**:",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 49,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "If any plugin is missing:",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 54,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Open **Settings** → **Templater**",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 89,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Set **Template Folder Location** to `99-system/01-quickadd/02-templates` (or wherever your templates folder is)",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 90,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Enable **Trigger Templater on new file creation** (optional but recommended)",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 91,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Under **Folder Templates** (optional):",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 92,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Open **Settings** → **Dataview**",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 97,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensure **Enable JavaScript Queries** is ON (required for DataviewJS blocks in Calibration Log and Dashboard)",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 98,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensure **Enable Inline Queries** is ON",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 100,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Set **Refresh Interval** to a reasonable value (e.g., 2500ms)",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 100,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Open **Settings** → **Meta Bind**",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 102,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "No special configuration needed — the buttons and inline selects in the templates will work with default settings",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 104,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Important:** Meta Bind buttons work in **Reading Mode** or **Live Preview** — switch to either mode to use the dashboard buttons",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 105,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensure the template paths in the Dashboard button configurations match your actual template paths:",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 109,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Open **Settings** → **QuickAdd**",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 115,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Click **Add Choice** at the top",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 115,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Name:** \"New SRL Reading Session\"",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 116,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Type:** Template",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 116,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Click the ⚙️ gear icon on the new choice:",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 117,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Repeat for Monthly Review and Framework Activation if desired",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 127,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Optionally add to command palette via **Manage Macros** or **Commander**",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 128,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**SRL-Living-Learning-Agenda:**",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 137,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**SRL-Calibration-Log:**",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 137,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**SRL-Dashboard-MOC:**",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 144,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Read** the Quick Reference Cards (Card 5: Early Implementation Survival Guide)",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 172,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Open** the SRL Dashboard MOC and review the Scaffold Fading Schedule",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 173,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Remember:** Start with ONLY Zones 1 and 3 of Forethought + Zone 1 of Self-Reflection",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 173,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Use QuickAdd or Templater to create a new session note",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 180,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Fill in the text title, type, and schema level when prompted",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 182,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Complete **Zone 1** (Prior Knowledge Activation) — even briefly",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 183,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Complete **Zone 3** (Goal Setting) — set ONE specific comprehension criterion",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 184,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Skip Zones 2, 4, 5 for now",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 184,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Read** your text with your process goals in mind",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 186,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "After reading, complete **Zone 1** of Self-Reflection (Cold Reconstruction)",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 188,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Skip remaining Self-Reflection zones for now",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 190,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "Update the Living Learning Agenda with one carry-forward item",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 190,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Focused Analysis Report** — Deep theoretical architecture with 5 practical tools",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 240,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Operational Guide** — 7 complete templates with zone-based architecture",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 242,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        },
        {
          "text": "**Practitioner Architecture** — Generativity-based calibration and closing-the-loop mechanisms",
          "indent_level": 0,
          "line_number": 243,
          "source": "SRL-System-Setup-Guide.md"
        }
